WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Qi Xuan and I were on Financial Street

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,400
Stopped a truck going the wrong way

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,480
Saw by the police

4
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,760
There are people taking pictures at the scene

5
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,840
Please take care of it too

6
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,280
OK I'll handle it

7
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,400
Contact Information Department

8
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,160
The Information Division protects the identity of the executive

9
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,520
The Propaganda Department controls public opinion

10
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,040
There's your sister in the car too

11
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,840
How could you do such a dangerous thing?

12
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,020
Captain becomes my sister

13
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,050
Even if you give me ten courages, I won’t dare

14
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,380
Let’s take notes together with examples

15
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,720
what did you do

16
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,200
Why is the truck not moving?

17
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,480
Let's talk, let's go

18
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:53,490
You can go wherever you are going.
